  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C). Cut the tofu into small cubes and toss with a little oil. Roast for 20-25 minutes, or until crispy.",
    "2. In a large bowl, combine the lettuce, red onion, cucumber, carrots, and roasted peanuts.",
    "3. In a small bowl, mix together the larb spice blend and a squeeze of lime juice.",
    "4. Add the roasted tofu to the bowl with the lettuce mixture and toss with the larb spice blend.",
    "5. Sprinkle with chopped cilantro and serve immediately."
